DM2OTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/events/91436925","actor":{"login":"daniilguit","id":231284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTI4NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit","html_url":"https://github.com/daniilguit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-02-06T19:22:41Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/35285331","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/2182#issuecomment-35285331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/2182","id":35285331,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1Mjg1MzMx","user":{"login":"daniilguit","id":231284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTI4NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit","html_url":"https://github.com/daniilguit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-02-17T14:20:38Z","updated_at":"2014-02-17T14:20:38Z","body":"Unfortunately it happens super rarely (today it happened 61 times, but other 5 000 000 times it is OK). My channel initializer I've already posted. My Request Handler is super simple (from the point of interaction with netty: it just detects whether it's GET or POST and if POST parses POST body).\n\nHandler: \n\n``` java\npublic class RequestHandler extends ChannelInboundHandlerAdapter {\n\n    @Override\n    public void exceptionCaught(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, Throwable cause) throws Exception {\n        if (!\"Connection reset by peer\".equals(cause.getMessage())) {\n            logger.error(\"Unhandled exception happened\", cause);\n        }\n        ctx.close();\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public void channelReadComplete(ChannelHandlerContext ctx) {\n        ctx.flush();\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public void channelRead(ChannelHandlerContext ctx, Object requestObject) throws Exception {\n        HttpRequest request = (HttpRequest) requestObject;\n\n        try {\n\n            if (is100ContinueExpected(request)) {\n                ctx.write(new DefaultFullHttpResponse(HttpVersion.HTTP_1_1, HttpResponseStatus.CONTINUE));\n            }\n\n            if (!request.getDecoderResult().isSuccess()) {\n                ctx.close();\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Matcher urlMathcer = URL_PATTERN.matcher(request.getUri());\n            HttpResponse response = null;\n            if (urlMathcer.matches()) {\n                String apiKey;\n                String action;\n                apiKey = urlMathcer.group(1);\n                action = urlMathcer.group(2);\n                switch (action) {\n                    case \"report\":\n                        response = requestHandlerConfig.reportHandler.response(request, ctx.channel(), apiKey);\n                        break;\n                    case \"ping\":\n                        response = requestHandlerConfig.pingHandler.response(request, ctx.channel(), apiKey);\n                        break;\n                    default:\n                        logger.warn(\"Unknown action for url: {}\", request.getUri());\n                }\n            } else {\n                response = new DefaultFullHttpResponse(HttpVersion.HTTP_1_0, HttpResponseStatus.BAD_REQUEST);\n            }\n\n            if (response != null) {\n                ctx.write(response).addListener(ChannelFutureListener.CLOSE);\n            } else {\n                ctx.close();\n            }\n        } finally {\n            if (request instanceof FullHttpRequest) {\n                ((FullHttpRequest)request).release();\n            } else {\n                // Happens sometimes :(\n                logger.warn(\"Not FullHttpRequest {}\", request.getClass());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/35285331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"daniilguit","id":231284,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTI4NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/231284?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit","html_url":"https://github.com/daniilguit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daniilguit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/da